  - id: salt_and_light
    displayName: Salt & Light
    flavorText: Jesus teaches the Beatitudes, the Lord's Prayer, and the ethics of
      the Kingdom in the Sermon on the Mount.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "Opens with the Beatitudes and moves through the Lord's Prayer, teaching
      on anger, adultery, oaths, retaliation, love of enemies, giving, prayer, fasting,
      treasure, worry, judging others, and the wise and foolish builders \u2014 the
      core statement of Kingdom ethics in Matthew."
