    flavorText: Jesus teaches the Parables of the Kingdom, comparing heaven to a
      mustard seed, hidden treasure, and a pearl of great price.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "A chapter of short earthly stories \u2014 the sower, the wheat and
      tares, the mustard seed, the leaven, the hidden treasure, the pearl of great
      price, the net \u2014 each illustrating some facet of what the Kingdom of Heaven
      is like."
